---
import AppDoc from '../../components/AppDoc.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<AppDoc title="商家後台" description="TransitGo 商家後台：登入一次，管理你認領的地標營業時間、電話、類型、連結與照片，不用安裝 App。">
<div class="page-head">
  <div class="page-icon" aria-hidden="true"><Icon name="box" size={34} /></div>
  <div>
    <h1>商家後台</h1>
    <p class="meta">用信箱登入一次，就能認領你的店家、管理營業時間／電話／類型／連結／照片——之後回來不用再重新驗證。</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="login-view">
  <div class="card">
    <label class="field-label" for="login-email">你的 Email</label>
    <input type="email" id="login-email" placeholder="you@example.com" class="field" />
    <button id="login-send" class="btn primary btn-block">寄送驗證碼</button>
    <div id="login-code-row" class="hidden">
      <label class="field-label" for="login-code">驗證碼</label>
      <input type="text" id="login-code" placeholder="信箱收到的驗證碼" class="field" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="10" autocomplete="one-time-code" />
      <button id="login-verify" class="btn primary btn-block">驗證並登入</button>
    </div>
    <p id="login-status" class="hint"></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="business-view" class="hidden">
  <div class="row-between">
    <p class="hint">已登入：<strong id="whoami"></strong></p>
    <button id="logout-btn" class="btn">登出</button>
  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">我認領的店家</h2>
  <ul id="mine-list" class="list"></ul>
  <p id="mine-empty" class="hidden empty-state">還沒有認領任何地標——在下面搜尋或新增一個。</p>

  <h2 class="section-title">認領一個地標</h2>
  <p class="meta-sm">搜尋地標名稱（要先在 App 裡被使用者新增過、且已經通過後台審核，才搜尋得到）。</p>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="search-row">
      <input type="text" id="search-q" placeholder="地標名稱，至少 2 個字" class="field" />
      <button id="search-btn" class="btn primary">搜尋</button>
    </div>
    <ul id="search-list" class="list"></ul>
    <div id="search-empty" class="hidden empty-state">
      <p>查不到符合的地標，或都已經被認領了。</p>
      <p class="hint">如果這個地方只在 Apple 地圖上、還沒被加進我們的系統，可以直接新增：</p>
      <button id="show-new-form-btn" class="btn">＋ 新增這個地方並認領</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="new-landmark-card" class="card hidden">
    <h3 class="card-title">新增地標並認領</h3>
    <p class="meta-sm">送出後會直接標示為已驗證店家，之後可以在上面「我認領的店家」繼續管理。</p>
    <label class="field-label" for="new-name">店名</label>
    <input type="text" id="new-name" placeholder="跟 Apple 地圖上顯示的名稱一致比較好找" class="field" />

    <label class="field-label">類型</label>
    <div class="category-picker" id="new-category-picker"></div>

    <label class="field-label">地點</label>
    <div class="location-row">
      <button id="use-location-btn" class="btn">📍 用我目前的位置</button>
      <span id="location-status" class="hint"></span>
    </div>

    <label class="field-label">營業時間</label>
    <div class="hours-editor" id="new-hours-editor"></div>

    <label class="field-label" for="new-phone">電話（選填）</label>
    <input type="text" id="new-phone" placeholder="電話" class="field" />

    <label class="field-label">連結（選填）</label>
    <div class="links-editor" id="new-links-editor"></div>

    <label class="field-label">照片（選填，最多 6 張）</label>
    <div class="photo-editor" id="new-photo-editor"></div>

    <p id="new-status" class="hint"></p>
    <div class="new-actions">
      <button id="new-cancel-btn" class="btn">取消</button>
      <button id="new-submit-btn" class="btn primary" disabled>新增並認領</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<template id="claim-template">
  <li class="item">
    <p class="item-name"></p>
    <p class="item-meta"></p>
    <div class="claim-form hidden">
      <label class="field-label">營業時間（選填）</label>
      <input type="text" class="claim-hours field" placeholder="例如：週一至週日 11:00–21:00" />
      <label class="field-label">電話（選填）</label>
      <input type="text" class="claim-phone field" placeholder="電話" />
      <p class="claim-status hint"></p>
      <button class="claim-submit btn primary btn-block">認領這個地標</button>
    </div>
    <button class="claim-toggle btn">認領這裡</button>
  </li>
</template>

<template id="mine-template">
  <li class="item">
    <p class="item-name"></p>
    <p class="item-meta"></p>
    <p class="item-link hint"></p>
    <div class="edit-form hidden">
      <label class="field-label">營業狀態</label>
      <select class="edit-status field">
        <option value="open">營業中</option>
        <option value="temporarily_closed">暫停營業</option>
        <option value="permanently_closed">已停業</option>
      </select>

      <label class="field-label">類型</label>
      <div class="category-picker edit-category-picker"></div>

      <label class="field-label">營業時間</label>
      <div class="hours-editor edit-hours-editor"></div>

      <label class="field-label">電話</label>
      <input type="text" class="edit-phone field" placeholder="電話" />

      <label class="field-label">連結（選填）</label>
      <div class="links-editor edit-links-editor"></div>

      <label class="field-label">照片（選填，最多 6 張）</label>
      <div class="photo-editor edit-photo-editor"></div>

      <p class="edit-status-msg hint"></p>
      <button class="edit-submit btn primary btn-block">儲存</button>
    </div>
    <button class="edit-toggle btn">編輯</button>
  </li>
</template>

<h2 class="section-title">需要幫忙</h2>
<p>信箱收不到驗證碼、或這個地標還沒被任何人新增過，寄信到 <a href="mailto:app&#64;yayalin.com">app&#64;yayalin.com</a>。</p>
</AppDoc>

<style>
  .page-head { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .page-head h1 { margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .page-icon {
    flex: none; width: 52px; height: 52px; border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    color: var(--accent); background: linear-gradient(150deg, var(--accent-soft), transparent);
  }
  .section-title { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
  .meta-sm { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.2rem 0 0.6rem; }
  .card { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .card-title { font-size: 1.02rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; }
  .field-label { display: block; font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.7rem 0 0.2rem; }
  .field-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }
  .field {
    display: block; width: 100%; background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; color: var(--text); font: inherit; margin: 0;
  }
  .field:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--accent); }
  .search-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
  .search-row .field { flex: 1; }
  .location-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .new-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .new-actions .btn.primary { flex: 1; }
  .row-between { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; border: 1px solid var(--line);
    background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); cursor: pointer; transition: border-color .15s, background-color .15s;
  }
  .btn:hover { border-color: var(--accent); }
  .btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: default; border-color: var(--line); }
  .btn.primary { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: transparent; }
  .btn.primary:hover { background: var(--accent); filter: brightness(1.08); }
  .btn-block { width: 100%; margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .hint { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.4rem 0 0; }
  .hidden { display: none; }
  .empty-state { background: var(--bg); border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; margin: 0.8rem 0 0; }
  .empty-state p { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .empty-state p:last-of-type { margin-bottom: 0.7rem; }
  .list { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0.8rem 0; display: grid; gap: 0.7rem; }
  .item { background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1rem 1.1rem; }
  .item-name { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-size: 1.02rem; }
  .item-meta { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--muted); margin: 0.25rem 0 0.6rem; }
  .claim-form, .edit-form { display: grid; gap: 0; margin-top: 0.7rem; padding-top: 0.8rem; border-top: 1px dashed var(--line); }

  /* ---- 分類選擇器（先選大分類，再選細項）---- */
  .category-picker { display: grid; gap: 6px; }

  /* ---- 營業時間滑桿編輯器 ---- */
  .hours-editor { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .hours-day { background: var(--bg); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem 0.7rem; }
  .hours-day-head { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .hours-day-label { font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.88rem; min-width: 3.2em; }
  .hours-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; }
  .hours-toggle input { accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .hours-sliders { display: grid; gap: 6px; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
  .hours-sliders.hidden { display: none; }
  .hours-slider-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .hours-time { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent); min-width: 3.4em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .hours-range { flex: 1; accent-color: var(--accent); }
  .hours-range:disabled { opacity: 0.4; }

  /* ---- 連結編輯器 ---- */
  .links-editor { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
  .links-editor .field-label { margin: 0.4rem 0 0.15rem; }
  .links-editor .field-label:first-child { margin-top: 0; }

  /* ---- 照片編輯器 ---- */
  .photo-editor { display: grid; gap: 8px; }
  .photo-file-input { font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .photo-thumbs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
  .photo-thumb { display: grid; gap: 4px; width: 108px; }
  .photo-thumb img { width: 108px; height: 108px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); }
  .photo-thumb select { font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 3px 4px; }
  .photo-thumb .photo-remove-btn { font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 3px 6px; }
</style>

<script>
  import { supabase } from '../../lib/supabase';
  import { CATEGORY_LABEL } from '../../../functions/_lib/landmarkCategories.js';
  import { GROUP_LABEL, GROUP_ORDER, groupOf } from '../../../functions/_lib/landmarkCategoryGroups.js';
  import { LINK_LABEL, LINK_ORDER } from '../../../functions/_lib/landmarkLinks.js';
  import { PHOTO_CATEGORY_LABEL } from '../../../functions/_lib/landmarkPhotoCategories.js';

  const API = '/app/api/business';
  // Every call site in this file passes a bare element id ("login-send"), meaning
  // "#login-send" — but querySelector treats an unprefixed string as a TAG name, so it was
  // silently matching nothing and returning null for every one of them. That made the very
  // first `$(...).addEventListener(...)` below throw (can't read addEventListener of null),
  // which killed the whole script before it ever reached renderForSession() or wired up a
  // single button — nothing on this page worked, not just "send verification email".
  // Prepending "#" only when the caller hasn't already supplied a real selector (the couple
  // of `$('#mine-template')`-style calls already work either way) fixes every call site at
  // once instead of touching them all individually.
  const $ = (sel: string, root: ParentNode = document) =>
    root.querySelector(/^[#.[]/.test(sel) ? sel : `#${sel}`) as HTMLElement;

  async function authedFetch(path: string, opts: RequestInit = {}) {
    const { data } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
    const token = data.session?.access_token;
    if (!token) return { ok: false, status: 401, data: null };
    const res = await fetch(API + path, { ...opts, headers: { ...(opts.headers || {}), authorization: `Bearer ${token}` } });
    return { ok: res.ok, status: res.status, data: await res.json().catch(() => null) };
  }

  /* ==================== 共用小工具：分類選擇器／營業時間滑桿／連結／照片 ====================
     這四個都要同時用在「新增地標」卡片跟每一筆「我認領的店家」的編輯表單裡（後者會被
     mine-template clone 出好幾份，每份都要有自己獨立的一組），所以都寫成「餵一個容器
     element 進去、回傳 {get,set}」的小工廠函式，兩邊直接重複使用同一套邏輯。 */

  // ---- 分類：先選大分類，再選細項 ----
  function buildCategoryPicker(container: HTMLElement) {
    container.innerHTML = `<select class="cat-group field"></select><select class="cat-fine field"></select>`;
    const groupSel = container.querySelector('.cat-group') as HTMLSelectElement;
    const fineSel = container.querySelector('.cat-fine') as HTMLSelectElement;
    for (const g of GROUP_ORDER) {
      const opt = document.createElement('option');
      opt.value = g;
      opt.textContent = (GROUP_LABEL as Record<string, string>)[g];
      groupSel.appendChild(opt);
    }
    function populateFine(group: string, selected?: string) {
      fineSel.innerHTML = '';
      for (const [value, label] of Object.entries(CATEGORY_LABEL)) {
        if (groupOf(value) !== group) continue;
        const opt = document.createElement('option');
        opt.value = value;
        opt.textContent = label as string;
        if (value === selected) opt.selected = true;
        fineSel.appendChild(opt);
      }
    }
    groupSel.addEventListener('change', () => populateFine(groupSel.value));
    groupSel.value = 'other';
    populateFine('other', 'other');
    return {
      get: () => fineSel.value,
      set: (category: string) => {
        const group = groupOf(category);
        groupSel.value = group;
        populateFine(group, category);
      },
    };
  }

  // ---- 營業時間：每天一組滑桿，可設公休／24 小時營業 ----
  const WEEKDAYS = ['mon', 'tue', 'wed', 'thu', 'fri', 'sat', 'sun'];
  const DAY_LABEL: Record<string, string> = { mon: '週一', tue: '週二', wed: '週三', thu: '週四', fri: '週五', sat: '週六', sun: '週日' };
  type DayHours = { open: string; close: string } | null;

  function minToHHMM(min: number) {
    const h = Math.floor(min / 60).toString().padStart(2, '0');
    const m = (min % 60).toString().padStart(2, '0');
    return `${h}:${m}`;
  }
  function hhmmToMin(hhmm: string) {
    const [h, m] = hhmm.split(':').map(Number);
    return h * 60 + m;
  }

  function buildHoursEditor(container: HTMLElement) {
    container.innerHTML = WEEKDAYS.map((d) => `
      <div class="hours-day" data-day="${d}">
        <div class="hours-day-head">
          <span class="hours-day-label">${DAY_LABEL[d]}</span>
          <label class="hours-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="hours-open-toggle" checked /> 營業</label>
          <label class="hours-toggle"><input type="checkbox" class="hours-24h" /> 24 小時</label>
        </div>
        <div class="hours-sliders">
          <div class="hours-slider-row">
            <span class="hours-time open">09:00</span>
            <input type="range" class="hours-range open" min="0" max="1435" step="5" value="540" />
          </div>
          <div class="hours-slider-row">
            <span class="hours-time close">21:00</span>
            <input type="range" class="hours-range close" min="0" max="1435" step="5" value="1260" />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    `).join('');

    const days = WEEKDAYS.map((day) => {
      const dayEl = container.querySelector(`[data-day="${day}"]`) as HTMLElement;
      const openToggle = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-open-toggle') as HTMLInputElement;
      const h24 = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-24h') as HTMLInputElement;
      const sliders = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-sliders') as HTMLElement;
      const openRange = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-range.open') as HTMLInputElement;
      const closeRange = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-range.close') as HTMLInputElement;
      const openLabel = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-time.open') as HTMLElement;
      const closeLabel = dayEl.querySelector('.hours-time.close') as HTMLElement;

      const refresh = () => {
        sliders.classList.toggle('hidden', !openToggle.checked);
        const disabled = !openToggle.checked || h24.checked;
        openRange.disabled = disabled;
        closeRange.disabled = disabled;
        openLabel.textContent = minToHHMM(Number(openRange.value));
        closeLabel.textContent = minToHHMM(Number(closeRange.value));
      };
      openToggle.addEventListener('change', refresh);
      h24.addEventListener('change', () => {
        if (h24.checked) { openRange.value = '0'; closeRange.value = '1435'; }
        refresh();
      });
      openRange.addEventListener('input', refresh);
      closeRange.addEventListener('input', refresh);
      refresh();

      return { day, openToggle, h24, openRange, closeRange, refresh };
    });

    return {
      get(): Record<string, DayHours> {
        const out: Record<string, DayHours> = {};
        for (const d of days) {
          if (!d.openToggle.checked) { out[d.day] = null; continue; }
          if (d.h24.checked) { out[d.day] = { open: '00:00', close: '23:59' }; continue; }
          let om = Number(d.openRange.value);
          let cm = Number(d.closeRange.value);
          if (om === cm) cm = (cm + 5) % 1440;   // sanitizeHours rejects open === close
          out[d.day] = { open: minToHHMM(om), close: minToHHMM(cm) };
        }
        return out;
      },
      set(hours: Record<string, DayHours> | null | undefined) {
        for (const d of days) {
          const entry = hours?.[d.day] ?? null;
          d.openToggle.checked = entry !== null;
          if (entry) {
            d.h24.checked = entry.open === '00:00' && entry.close === '23:59';
            d.openRange.value = String(hhmmToMin(entry.open));
            d.closeRange.value = String(hhmmToMin(entry.close));
          } else {
            d.h24.checked = false;
          }
          d.refresh();
        }
      },
    };
  }

  // ---- 外部連結：菜單／線上點餐／官網／外送 ----
  function buildLinksEditor(container: HTMLElement) {
    container.innerHTML = LINK_ORDER.map((key: string) => `
      <label class="field-label">${(LINK_LABEL as Record<string, string>)[key]}</label>
      <input type="url" class="field link-input" data-key="${key}" placeholder="https://" />
    `).join('');
    const inputs = Object.fromEntries(
      LINK_ORDER.map((key: string) => [key, container.querySelector(`[data-key="${key}"]`) as HTMLInputElement]),
    ) as Record<string, HTMLInputElement>;
    return {
      get(): Record<string, string> {
        const out: Record<string, string> = {};
        for (const key of LINK_ORDER) { const v = inputs[key].value.trim(); if (v) out[key] = v; }
        return out;
      },
      set(links: Record<string, string> | null | undefined) {
        for (const key of LINK_ORDER) inputs[key].value = links?.[key] ?? '';
      },
    };
  }

  // ---- 照片：選檔案 → 縮圖壓縮成 JPEG data URL → 逐張選分類 ----
  const MAX_PHOTOS = 6;
  type Photo = { url: string; category: string };

  function encodePhoto(file: File): Promise<string> {
    return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {
      const reader = new FileReader();
      reader.onerror = () => reject(reader.error);
      reader.onload = () => {
        const img = new Image();
        img.onerror = () => reject(new Error('bad image'));
        img.onload = () => {
          const maxDim = 1280;
          const scale = Math.min(1, maxDim / Math.max(img.width, img.height));
          const w = Math.max(1, Math.round(img.width * scale));
          const h = Math.max(1, Math.round(img.height * scale));
          const canvas = document.createElement('canvas');
          canvas.width = w;
          canvas.height = h;
          const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
          if (!ctx) { reject(new Error('no canvas context')); return; }
          ctx.drawImage(img, 0, 0, w, h);
          resolve(canvas.toDataURL('image/jpeg', 0.8));
        };
        img.src = reader.result as string;
      };
      reader.readAsDataURL(file);
    });
  }

  function buildPhotoEditor(container: HTMLElement) {
    let photos: Photo[] = [];
    container.innerHTML = `
      <input type="file" class="photo-file-input" accept="image/*" multiple />
      <div class="photo-thumbs"></div>
      <p class="photo-status hint"></p>
    `;
    const fileInput = container.querySelector('.photo-file-input') as HTMLInputElement;
    const thumbs = container.querySelector('.photo-thumbs') as HTMLElement;
    const status = container.querySelector('.photo-status') as HTMLElement;

    function render() {
      thumbs.innerHTML = '';
      photos.forEach((p, i) => {
        const row = document.createElement('div');
        row.className = 'photo-thumb';
        row.innerHTML = `<img src="${p.url}" alt="" /><select class="photo-cat-select"></select><button type="button" class="photo-remove-btn btn">移除</button>`;
        const sel = row.querySelector('.photo-cat-select') as HTMLSelectElement;
        for (const [value, label] of Object.entries(PHOTO_CATEGORY_LABEL)) {
          const opt = document.createElement('option');
          opt.value = value;
          opt.textContent = label as string;
          if (value === p.category) opt.selected = true;
          sel.appendChild(opt);
        }
        sel.addEventListener('change', () => { photos[i].category = sel.value; });
        (row.querySelector('.photo-remove-btn') as HTMLButtonElement).addEventListener('click', () => {
          photos.splice(i, 1);
          render();
        });
        thumbs.appendChild(row);
      });
    }

    fileInput.addEventListener('change', async () => {
      const files = Array.from(fileInput.files ?? []);
      fileInput.value = '';
      const room = MAX_PHOTOS - photos.length;
      if (room <= 0) { status.textContent = `最多 ${MAX_PHOTOS} 張，請先移除幾張再加。`; return; }
      const toEncode = files.slice(0, room);
      status.textContent = '處理照片中…';
      for (const f of toEncode) {
        try { photos.push({ url: await encodePhoto(f), category: 'other' }); } catch { /* 這張讀不出來就跳過，不擋其他張 */ }
      }
      status.textContent = files.length > toEncode.length ? `最多 ${MAX_PHOTOS} 張，多的先不放。` : '';
      render();
    });

    return {
      get: () => photos,
      set: (p: Photo[] | null | undefined) => { photos = p ? p.map((x) => ({ ...x })) : []; render(); },
    };
  }

  /* ---------- 登入（Supabase Auth，六碼驗證碼；第一次使用會自動建立帳號）----------
     signInWithOtp 寄出的同一封信本來就含 {{ .Token }}（跟點連結是同一支信、同一個
     Supabase Auth 寄信管道，只是不用等使用者去點連結、直接在這頁輸入碼）——用
     verifyOtp(email, token) 換成真正的 session，後面 authedFetch／封鎖商家帳號等既有機制
     完全不用改。 */
  const loginView = $('login-view');
  const businessView = $('business-view');
  const loginEmail = $('login-email') as HTMLInputElement;
  const loginStatus = $('login-status');
  const loginCodeRow = $('login-code-row');
  const loginCode = $('login-code') as HTMLInputElement;

  $('login-send').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const email = loginEmail.value.trim();
    if (!email.includes('@')) { loginStatus.textContent = '請輸入正確的 Email。'; return; }
    (($('login-send') as HTMLButtonElement)).disabled = true;
    loginStatus.textContent = '寄送中…';
    const { error } = await supabase.auth.signInWithOtp({
      email,
      options: { shouldCreateUser: true },
    });
    (($('login-send') as HTMLButtonElement)).disabled = false;
    if (error) {
      loginStatus.textContent = '寄送失敗，請確認 Email 是否正確。';
      return;
    }
    loginStatus.textContent = `驗證碼已寄到 ${email}，請輸入信裡的驗證碼（10 分鐘內有效，可能在垃圾信件夾）。`;
    loginCodeRow.classList.remove('hidden');
    loginCode.value = '';
    loginCode.focus();
  });

  // 換信箱重寄一次就等於放棄剛剛那組碼——把輸入框跟碼列隱藏掉，逼使用者重新走一次寄送。
  loginEmail.addEventListener('input', () => {
    loginCodeRow.classList.add('hidden');
    loginCode.value = '';
  });

  $('login-verify').addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const email = loginEmail.value.trim();
    const token = loginCode.value.trim();
    if (!token) { loginStatus.textContent = '請輸入驗證碼。'; return; }
    (($('login-verify') as HTMLButtonElement)).disabled = true;
    loginStatus.textContent = '驗證中…';
    const { error } = await supabase.auth.verifyOtp({ email, token, type: 'email' });
    (($('login-verify') as HTMLButtonElement)).disabled = false;
    if (error) {
      loginStatus.textContent = '驗證碼不正確或已過期，請重新寄送。';
      return;
    }
    loginStatus.textContent = '';
    renderForSession();
  });
  $('logout-btn').addEventListener('click', async () => { await supabase.auth.signOut(); });

  async function renderForSession() {
    const { data } = await supabase.auth.getSession();
    if (data.session?.user.email) {
      loginView.classList.add('hidden');
      businessView.classList.remove('hidden');
      ($('whoami') as HTMLElement).textContent = data.session.user.email;
      loadMine();
    } else {
      loginView.classList.remove('hidden');
      businessView.classList.add('hidden');
      loginCodeRow.classList.add('hidden');
      loginCode.value = '';
    }
  }
  supabase.auth.onAuthStateChange(() => renderForSession());
  renderForSession();

  /* ---------- 我認領的店家 ---------- */
  const mineTemplate = $('#mine-template') as HTMLTemplateElement;
  const mineList = $('mine-list');
  const mineEmpty = $('mine-empty');

  interface MyLandmark {
    id: number; name: string; category: string; businessHours: string | null; phone: string | null;
    businessStatus: 'open' | 'temporarily_closed' | 'permanently_closed'; approved: boolean;
    hours?: Record<string, DayHours> | null; links?: Record<string, string> | null; photos?: Photo[] | null;
  }
  const STATUS_LABEL: Record<string, string> = { open: '營業中', temporarily_closed: '暫停營業', permanently_closed: '已停業' };

  function renderMine(landmarks: MyLandmark[]) {
    mineList.innerHTML = '';
    if (landmarks.length === 0) { mineEmpty.classList.remove('hidden'); return; }
    mineEmpty.classList.add('hidden');
    for (const l of landmarks) {
      const node = mineTemplate.content.cloneNode(true) as DocumentFragment;
      const li = node.querySelector('.item')!;
      (li.querySelector('.item-name') as HTMLElement).textContent = l.name;
      (li.querySelector('.item-meta') as HTMLElement).textContent =
        `${l.approved ? '已上架' : '待後台審核'} · ${STATUS_LABEL[l.businessStatus] ?? l.businessStatus}`;
      const linkEl = li.querySelector('.item-link') as HTMLElement;
      if (l.approved) {
        const url = `${location.origin}/shop/${l.id}`;
        linkEl.innerHTML = `商家頁面：<a href="${url}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">${url}</a>`;
      } else {
        linkEl.textContent = '商家頁面要等後台審核通過才會生效。';
      }
      const toggle = li.querySelector('.edit-toggle') as HTMLButtonElement;
      const form = li.querySelector('.edit-form') as HTMLElement;
      const statusSel = li.querySelector('.edit-status') as HTMLSelectElement;
      const categoryPicker = buildCategoryPicker(li.querySelector('.edit-category-picker') as HTMLElement);
      const hoursEditor = buildHoursEditor(li.querySelector('.edit-hours-editor') as HTMLElement);
      const phoneInput = li.querySelector('.edit-phone') as HTMLInputElement;
      const linksEditor = buildLinksEditor(li.querySelector('.edit-links-editor') as HTMLElement);
      const photoEditor = buildPhotoEditor(li.querySelector('.edit-photo-editor') as HTMLElement);
      const statusMsg = li.querySelector('.edit-status-msg') as HTMLElement;
      const submitBtn = li.querySelector('.edit-submit') as HTMLButtonElement;
      statusSel.value = l.businessStatus;
      categoryPicker.set(l.category);
      hoursEditor.set(l.hours ?? null);
      phoneInput.value = l.phone ?? '';
      linksEditor.set(l.links ?? null);
      photoEditor.set(l.photos ?? null);
      toggle.addEventListener('click', () => form.classList.toggle('hidden'));
      submitBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        statusMsg.textContent = '儲存中…';
        const photos = photoEditor.get();
        const links = linksEditor.get();
        const { ok, data } = await authedFetch(`/landmarks/${l.id}`, {
          method: 'PUT',
          headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({
            phone: phoneInput.value, businessStatus: statusSel.value, category: categoryPicker.get(),
            hours: hoursEditor.get(), links: Object.keys(links).length ? links : null,
            photos: photos.length ? photos : null,
          }),
        });
        submitBtn.disabled = false;
        if (ok) {
          statusMsg.textContent = '已儲存。';
          (li.querySelector('.item-meta') as HTMLElement).textContent =
            `${l.approved ? '已上架' : '待後台審核'} · ${STATUS_LABEL[statusSel.value] ?? statusSel.value}`;
        } else {
          statusMsg.textContent = data?.error === 'unauthorized' ? '登入已過期，請重新整理頁面登入。' : '儲存失敗，請稍後再試。';
        }
      });
      mineList.appendChild(node);
    }
  }

  async function loadMine() {
    const { ok, data } = await authedFetch('/mine', { method: 'POST' });
    if (ok) renderMine(data?.landmarks ?? []);
  }

  /* ---------- 認領一個地標 ---------- */
  const searchInput = $('search-q') as HTMLInputElement;
  const searchBtn = $('search-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const searchList = $('search-list');
  const searchEmpty = $('search-empty');
  const claimTemplate = $('claim-template') as HTMLTemplateElement;

  interface SearchResult { id: number; name: string; category: string; isBusinessClaim: boolean; businessVerified: boolean }

  searchBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const q = searchInput.value.trim();
    if (q.length < 2) return;
    searchBtn.disabled = true;
    const res = await fetch(`${API}/search?q=${encodeURIComponent(q)}`);
    searchBtn.disabled = false;
    const data = res.ok ? await res.json() : { landmarks: [] };
    const results: SearchResult[] = data.landmarks ?? [];
    searchList.innerHTML = '';
    newLandmarkCard.classList.add('hidden');
    if (results.length === 0) { searchEmpty.classList.remove('hidden'); return; }
    searchEmpty.classList.add('hidden');
    for (const r of results) {
      const node = claimTemplate.content.cloneNode(true) as DocumentFragment;
      const li = node.querySelector('.item')!;
      (li.querySelector('.item-name') as HTMLElement).textContent = r.name;
      (li.querySelector('.item-meta') as HTMLElement).textContent = r.businessVerified ? '已經有人認領了' : '還沒有店家認領';
      const toggle = li.querySelector('.claim-toggle') as HTMLButtonElement;
      const form = li.querySelector('.claim-form') as HTMLElement;
      if (r.businessVerified) {
        toggle.disabled = true;
        toggle.textContent = '已被認領';
      } else {
        toggle.addEventListener('click', () => form.classList.toggle('hidden'));
      }
      const hoursInput = li.querySelector('.claim-hours') as HTMLInputElement;
      const phoneInput = li.querySelector('.claim-phone') as HTMLInputElement;
      const statusMsg = li.querySelector('.claim-status') as HTMLElement;
      const submitBtn = li.querySelector('.claim-submit') as HTMLButtonElement;
      submitBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
        submitBtn.disabled = true;
        statusMsg.textContent = '送出中…';
        const { ok, data: claimData } = await authedFetch(`/landmarks/${r.id}/claim`, {
          method: 'POST',
          headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
          body: JSON.stringify({ businessHours: hoursInput.value, phone: phoneInput.value }),
        });
        if (ok) {
          statusMsg.textContent = '認領成功！在上面「我認領的店家」可以再繼續設定類型、營業時間、連結與照片。';
          toggle.disabled = true;
          toggle.textContent = '已認領';
          loadMine();
        } else {
          statusMsg.textContent = claimData?.error === 'unauthorized' ? '登入已過期，請重新整理頁面登入。' : '認領失敗（可能剛好被別人搶先認領），請重新整理再試。';
          submitBtn.disabled = false;
        }
      });
      searchList.appendChild(node);
    }
  });

  /* ---------- 新增地標並認領（用於「原本只存在 Apple 地圖，還沒加進我們系統」的地方）----------
     網頁沒有地圖/地址轉座標的工具，用瀏覽器定位取代——商家實際站在店裡按一下最直接，也不用
     另外接第三方地圖/地址服務（跟這個網站本來就沒有第三方追蹤套件的原則一致）。 */
  const newLandmarkCard = $('new-landmark-card');
  const showNewFormBtn = $('show-new-form-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const newCancelBtn = $('new-cancel-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const newNameInput = $('new-name') as HTMLInputElement;
  const newCategoryPicker = buildCategoryPicker($('new-category-picker'));
  const useLocationBtn = $('use-location-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;
  const locationStatus = $('location-status');
  const newHoursEditor = buildHoursEditor($('new-hours-editor'));
  const newPhoneInput = $('new-phone') as HTMLInputElement;
  const newLinksEditor = buildLinksEditor($('new-links-editor'));
  const newPhotoEditor = buildPhotoEditor($('new-photo-editor'));
  const newStatus = $('new-status');
  const newSubmitBtn = $('new-submit-btn') as HTMLButtonElement;

  let newCoordinate: { lat: number; lon: number } | null = null;

  function updateSubmitEnabled() {
    newSubmitBtn.disabled = !newNameInput.value.trim() || !newCoordinate;
  }
  newNameInput.addEventListener('input', updateSubmitEnabled);

  showNewFormBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    newLandmarkCard.classList.remove('hidden');
    newNameInput.value = searchInput.value.trim();
    updateSubmitEnabled();
    newNameInput.focus();
  });
  newCancelBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    newLandmarkCard.classList.add('hidden');
  });

  useLocationBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (!navigator.geolocation) { locationStatus.textContent = '這個瀏覽器不支援定位。'; return; }
    useLocationBtn.disabled = true;
    locationStatus.textContent = '定位中…';
    navigator.geolocation.getCurrentPosition(
      (pos) => {
        newCoordinate = { lat: pos.coords.latitude, lon: pos.coords.longitude };
        locationStatus.textContent = `已取得目前位置（精確度約 ${Math.round(pos.coords.accuracy)} 公尺）`;
        useLocationBtn.disabled = false;
        updateSubmitEnabled();
      },
      () => {
        locationStatus.textContent = '無法取得位置，請確認瀏覽器的定位權限。';
        useLocationBtn.disabled = false;
      },
      { enableHighAccuracy: true, timeout: 15000 },
    );
  });

  newSubmitBtn.addEventListener('click', async () => {
    const name = newNameInput.value.trim();
    if (!name || !newCoordinate) return;
    newSubmitBtn.disabled = true;
    newStatus.textContent = '送出中…';
    const links = newLinksEditor.get();
    const photos = newPhotoEditor.get();
    const { ok, data } = await authedFetch('/landmarks/new', {
      method: 'POST',
      headers: { 'content-type': 'application/json' },
      body: JSON.stringify({
        name, category: newCategoryPicker.get(), lat: newCoordinate.lat, lon: newCoordinate.lon,
        description: '', phone: newPhoneInput.value, hours: newHoursEditor.get(),
        links: Object.keys(links).length ? links : undefined,
        photos: photos.length ? photos : undefined,
      }),
    });
    if (ok) {
      newStatus.textContent = '新增成功！在上面「我認領的店家」就能看到與管理。';
      newLandmarkCard.classList.add('hidden');
      searchList.innerHTML = '';
      searchEmpty.classList.add('hidden');
      searchInput.value = '';
      loadMine();
    } else {
      newSubmitBtn.disabled = false;
      newStatus.textContent = data?.error === 'unauthorized' ? '登入已過期，請重新整理頁面登入。' : '新增失敗，請稍後再試。';
    }
  });
</script>
